<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan three-month NCDs single yield at 4.79 pct.</title>
<headline>Taiwan three-month NCDs single yield at 4.79 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank issued T$10 billion in three-month negotiable certificates of deposits on Wednesday at a single yield of 4.79 percent, a central bank official said.</p>
<p>Demand totalled T$12.6 billion.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
